	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Playing this magical trumpet allows up to 5 creatures within 50ft to move up to 60ft or their movement speed, whichever is lower, as a reaction. When a bard uses the cavalry’s charge to play a @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.j9awz4cxjbg9rdxe]{Song of Rest}, allies in the area do not roll the d8 but instead recover an additional 8hp. If the bard uses the cavalry’s charge to play a @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.865p8waxugaoh5up]{Marching Song}, the radius increases to 120ft.</p>",
